{"after_excerpt":{"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:c02e057438cd0337735985634743d3a5b8bca824f51563fda444ab3035f5fde2","joiner":"","kind":"HTML_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"360e1997471f23344b6218bfb240d8d622623b4b4a087f541c9dc9db2e4baf98","raw_text_sha256":"e19b33226f7a25445d77c24ecc29ed7b274ca9b6ae578ba56a5529acb40ead23","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":6407,"start":6371,"unit_ref":"html:1"}]},"text":"若〈獄官典卒〉容縱外人入獄及〈與囚𫝊通言語〉走泄事情於囚罪無增減者笞五十","text_sha256":"e19b33226f7a25445d77c24ecc29ed7b274ca9b6ae578ba56a5529acb40ead23"},"before_sha256":"60fc12bb02711841ac8866ea425e61e79dcf85c350fe3bc2b1e919bad87e9c9b","before_source":{"bibliography":{"citation":"《大清律例》（四库全书本）卷三十六","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%B8%85%E5%BE%8B%E4%BE%8B_(%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E5%8D%B736"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:6c1152b2d0b2177cc923dc0c1c04e2516dfb11af3521e2d7323862c5705b2c27","sha256":"6c1152b2d0b2177cc923dc0c1c04e2516dfb11af3521e2d7323862c5705b2c27"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:7b043682db995393b3804a123b2bd068fc4aa46d0a50c98b4763fbddc87b59e7","sha256":"7b043682db995393b3804a123b2bd068fc4aa46d0a50c98b4763fbddc87b59e7"},"id":"src:history:daqinglu:v36:outsider-access","locator":{"clause":"容纵外人入狱及传通言语","section":"主守教囚反异"},"locator_verification":{"reason":"EXCERPT_NOT_FOUND","status":"UNVERIFIED"},"notes":"仅用于监狱出入/传话的历史边界；不能反推曹稿具体探视场景。","text":"若獄官典卒容縱外人入獄及與囚傳通言語走泄事情於囚罪無增減者笞五十。","text_sha256":"0fea940cb6f29deeb95b4d82ab7bbb84a389f49df38a76934065499ff6d3f2e5","title":"《大清律例》卷三十六——限制外人入狱传话","type":"HISTORICAL_PRIMARY","witness":{"annotation":"刑律·断狱上·主守教囚反异","label":"《大清律例》卷三十六","siglum":"DQLL-V36"}},"claim_reviews":[{"claim_id":"claim:history:h01:controlled-access","claim_sha256":"3f3413a87f606581d299e76112cda8c59bd3ab87e3a0035aedbb4d8cf001acba","rationale":"原主张明确限制无关外人，并限定特定亲属按限入视；恢复盗犯家口禁入例外后，主张仍只表达受控机制。不得将它用作某类囚犯、旧仆或小说人物当然享有探视权的依据。","result":"RETAIN_EXISTING_ASSERTION"}],"impact":{"claims":[{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h01:controlled-access","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"DIRECT_ASSERTION","statement":"清代监狱规则限制无关外人自由入狱传话，同时允许特定亲属按限入视，送饮食须由提牢官验明后转送。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"DIRECT","source":"src:history:daqinglu:v36:outsider-access"},{"relation":"DIRECT","source":"src:history:daqinglu:v36:relative-visits"}]}],"decisions":[],"implementations":[],"title_axes":[]},"impact_sha256":"5239d8bdd6ae066bff8372b236f650dca1507ebfa71b1bc34d53655c78ad42d3","kind":"SOURCE_EXCERPT_CORRECTION","limitations":["此项为代理对本地数字录文及下游主张的复核，不冒充独立人工评审；逐字重取不等于馆藏原件或历史真实性鉴定。","保留原Source ID、type、witness、tier、bibliography和notes，以及全部Claim、Decision、Implementation与TitleAxis记录和权限。"],"omitted_line_breaks":[],"rationale":"采用固定四库全书本卷三十六页面原录文，保留夹注界符和“𫝊”，撤回旧引文未声明的界符删除、字形替换及句末补点。所选句仍载容纵外人入狱、传话且囚罪无增减的处罚条件。","reviewer":{"kind":"AGENT_TEXT_REVIEW","name":"Codex"},"schema_version":1,"source_id":"src:history:daqinglu:v36:outsider-access"}
